From 87c698f2a0a34cb67fd4394578a946ad4c897bc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:10:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf(tui_gateway): idle Desktop backends stop re-decoding the
 whole task replica and re-spawning git for non-repo cwds [daveey]

kanban_remote_observations decodes only replica task rows whose seq moved (live hub.db: 50->11 ms/pass);
git_probe negative cache trusts an unchanged cwd mtime for 300 s instead of re-probing every 30 s.
Card t_01a18977df212d21.
